    ["sehlabathebe", "Sehlabathebe", [15, 8, 10, 4], "offbeat trekking nature", "A remote high plateau of rock pools, sandstone arches and ancient San rock art, with almost no visitors.", "The road is rough; hike in from the South African side or use a 4x4."],
    ["thaba-bosiu", "Thaba-Bosiu", [15, 8, 4, 4], "history culture", "The flat-topped mountain fortress where King Moshoeshoe I founded Lesotho, with royal graves and wide views.", "An easy day trip from Maseru by minibus. Hire a local guide to hear the history."]
