    ["rodrigues", "Rodrigues", [30, 12, 4, 5], "offbeat beach nature", "A quiet island with coastal walks, a huge lagoon for snorkelling and kitesurfing, and a giant tortoise reserve.", "Fly or take the ferry from Mauritius. Guesthouses often include home-cooked Creole meals."]
