    ["tadjoura", "Tadjoura", [40, 12, 10, 25], "offbeat beach nature", "A white-walled town across the gulf, with whale sharks gathering offshore from November to February.", "Share boat trips for the whale sharks from Djibouti City. The ferry to Tadjoura is cheaper than a tour."]
