    ["ilheu-das-rolas", "Ilhéu das Rolas", [40, 15, 10, 5], "offbeat beach", "A small island right on the equator, with a marker for the line and quiet palm-fringed beaches.", "Take the cheap local boat from Porto Alegre rather than the resort transfer."]
